	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_baker_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしゃ　すきな　パンを　つくれて
まんぞく　してるけどさ▼
まいにち　パンと　みずだけで
みんな　だいじょうぶ　なのかね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T09:31:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:58:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしゃ　好きな　パンを　つくれて
満足してるけどさ▼
毎日　パンと　水だけで
みんな　大丈夫なのかね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:22:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:58:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
